  "local_id": "VRF Heat Pump Inspection",
  "oid": "287051945623973888",
  "description": "Outdoor and indoor inspection protocol for Mitsubishi Electric City Multi (VRF) systems. Covers physical/environmental checks, electrical diagnostics, refrigerant/mechanical inspection, and indoor unit operational metrics. Records measurements and routes to repair workflows as needed.",
