              "content": {
                "content": "Measure line-to-line voltage at the outdoor unit disconnect.\nRecord all three phase-to-phase readings (L1-L2, L2-L3, L1-L3).\nCalculate deviation: ((Max - Min) / Average) x 100.\nDeviation must be less than 2% for safe compressor operation.",
                "plainText": "Measure line-to-line voltage at the outdoor unit disconnect.\nRecord all three phase-to-phase readings (L1-L2, L2-L3, L1-L3).\nCalculate deviation: ((Max - Min) / Average) x 100.\nDeviation must be less than 2% for safe compressor operation."
              },
              "fontSize": 15
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 506,
              "width": 350,
              "height": 64,
              "content": {
                "content": "Voltage imbalance causes excessive current draw on one phase, leading to winding overheating and premature compressor failure.",
                "plainText": "Voltage imbalance causes excessive current draw on one phase, leading to winding overheating and premature compressor failure."
              },
              "fontSize": 13,
              "color": "#555555"
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "x": 95,
              "y": 680,
              "width": 200,
              "height": 44,
              "label": "Next",
              "outputValue": "done"
            }
