          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Open the electrical compartment cover.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000115",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Inspect all wiring for discolored insulation (brown, black, or melted).",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000116",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Discolored wires indicate overheating — replace immediately.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000117",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Torque all terminal screws to manufacturer specification.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000118",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Check contactor points for pitting or carbon buildup.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000119",
          "type": "SmallText",
          "value": "Loose terminals cause arcing, which generates heat and accelerates corrosion. Re-torque annually.",
