        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000170",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Take a photo of the leak area for the repair team.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000171",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "Open the \"Leak Repair\" workflow in Trajectory for the repair procedure.",
          "font_size": 15
        },
        {
          "oid": "6000000000172",
          "type": "Text",
          "value": "If the leak is severe, isolate the circuit at the service valve.",
